Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.76,0:00:15.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大胸…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.22,0:00:17.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,地震？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.39,0:00:26.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,最近還真常發生呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.96,0:00:48.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（29歲單身中堅冒險家的日常）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.45,0:01:59.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（第8話 村子的一員）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.41,0:02:00.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,多虧莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.78,0:02:03.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天史萊姆也抓超多的啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.79,0:02:05.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.29,0:02:07.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,婆婆！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.00,0:02:10.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始小弟\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.88,0:02:12.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,剛下工回來啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.54,0:02:13.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,對\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.55,0:02:16.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,多虧你們認真工作\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.05,0:02:19.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,讓村子和平多了 真是幫大忙啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.43,0:02:20.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝你們喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.30,0:02:21.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,來\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.85,0:02:26.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,糖果！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.31,0:02:28.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,以後也拜託你們顧好村子喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.02,0:02:29.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.94,0:02:32.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.32,0:02:43.99,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你就是那個駐村的吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.08,0:02:44.99,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,先下手為強！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.33,0:02:54.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可惡… 痛痛痛…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.34,0:02:56.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你突然出拳是在搞什麼…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.84,0:03:00.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等等！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.80,0:03:02.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你這也太不講理了吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.59,0:03:05.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我… 我們不是敵人！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.60,0:03:07.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我們是村子的自衛團成員！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.43,0:03:09.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,自衛團？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.77,0:03:12.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天就是那個啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.35,0:03:15.02,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你也許有點強沒錯\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.65,0:03:16.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但在這村子別太…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.28,0:03:21.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,別在這裡擺出一副很了不起的樣子…\n我是來講這個的啦…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.65,0:03:22.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,啥？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.49,0:03:25.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,總之意思就是 守護村子是我們…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.99,0:03:28.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,自衛團的工作啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.12,0:03:31.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（自衛團小嘍囉）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.37,0:03:33.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始先生 莉露！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.38,0:03:35.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你們回來啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.50,0:03:37.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,娜塔莉\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.63,0:03:38.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我回來啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.38,0:03:43.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,約翰！好久不見耶！！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.13,0:03:45.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你好啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.14,0:03:46.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,最近好嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.81,0:03:48.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,喔 嗯\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.64,0:03:54.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你喜歡娜塔莉對吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.65,0:03:57.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你 你這傢伙講什麼！！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.15,0:04:02.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我前陣子也為了“喜歡不喜歡”\n煩到不行嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.32,0:04:04.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你才跑來娜塔莉家的旅館\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.24,0:04:06.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,跟住在那裡的我找碴打架啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.32,0:04:08.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,懂懂懂！我懂我懂！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.79,0:04:10.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,戀愛這種事真的超難的啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.71,0:04:12.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,所以\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.41,0:04:14.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,娜塔莉呢？你怎麼想？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.54,0:04:16.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,欸？呃…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.46,0:04:19.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我… 我覺得約翰\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.92,0:04:22.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就只是… 很好的朋友…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.17,0:04:25.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,被甩啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.68,0:04:29.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你去死啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.97,0:04:31.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,很危險耶！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.93,0:04:35.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你這傢伙居然算村子的一員…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.81,0:04:38.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我可還沒承認你喔！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.44,0:04:39.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋！約翰！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.86,0:04:41.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,別鬧了啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.44,0:04:42.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦回去吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.03,0:04:44.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你又打不贏\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.61,0:04:46.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,去死啦笨蛋！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.91,0:04:50.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟約翰是有什麼過節嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.24,0:04:53.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,沒啦 就他在那邊說什麼\n“守護村子是我”之類的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.58,0:04:57.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,因為他是自衛團的人嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.08,0:05:00.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,約翰很喜歡村子啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.01,0:05:04.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,剛把人拒絕還笑得那麼燦爛…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.22,0:05:09.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.22,0:05:13.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,他說不承認你是村子的一員\n這是什麼意思？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.39,0:05:16.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始不是這個村子的人嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.48,0:05:18.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是啦 我是這村子的人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.48,0:05:21.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是駐村冒險者嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.36,0:05:27.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可是那傢伙剛剛說不承認耶\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.11,0:05:29.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,因為我來這村子還沒多久\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.28,0:05:32.49,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我是在撿到你之前不久才來的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.83,0:05:34.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,原來是這樣喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.50,0:05:35.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,對\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.50,0:05:37.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可是娜塔莉\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.75,0:05:39.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,還有旅館的大叔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.50,0:05:41.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,還有奧利弗姐姐都好溫柔喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.00,0:05:42.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.55,0:05:47.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,他們工作上本來就常跟外人接觸\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.38,0:05:49.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,所以很自然就接受我了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.51,0:05:53.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不過要成為真正的村子一員\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.35,0:05:54.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,還得花不少時間吧…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.02,0:05:59.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那像你傍晚那樣跟人吵架\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.98,0:06:02.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我覺得還是別做比較好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.94,0:06:06.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,走啦 去吃晚飯啦 莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.28,0:06:09.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你在轉移話題…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.42,0:06:20.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的… 又來了喔…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.55,0:06:34.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,危險度“準災害級”的魔獸\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.35,0:06:36.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,尖刺龍\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.60,0:06:38.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在國見山被目擊到了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.81,0:06:40.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,尖刺龍？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.98,0:06:42.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,國見山的話\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.61,0:06:44.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不就隔兩座山而已嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.52,0:06:47.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼那種東西會跑到村子附近…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.32,0:06:50.82,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,推測是牠乘在休息中的“渡行鯨”背上\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.03,0:06:53.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,一路被載到這裡來的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.32,0:06:55.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,尖刺龍\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.20,0:06:58.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是棲息於科庫希地區的兇暴魔獸\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.46,0:07:01.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,全身覆滿堅硬的尖刺\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.58,0:07:02.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,牠在國見山\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.88,0:07:06.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大概是在跟當地魔獸爭地盤吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.09,0:07:08.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,最近頻發的地震\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.51,0:07:10.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,會不會就是牠造成的？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.34,0:07:14.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,準災害級魔獸的討伐\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.26,0:07:17.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,通常要動員多少人來著？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.35,0:07:19.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,一般是由銀等級冒險者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.73,0:07:21.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,以數人小隊承接的案件\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.85,0:07:23.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,銀等級…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.98,0:07:25.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,還得組隊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.61,0:07:28.82,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始小弟\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.49,0:07:33.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是比銀等級更強的白銀等級嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.82,0:07:35.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你若要打 怎麼看？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.37,0:07:39.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我沒跟那傢伙交手過\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.54,0:07:42.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要我一個人去扛“銀等級幾人小隊”的案件\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.42,0:07:44.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,老實說會怕…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.54,0:07:46.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什麼啦… 也太沒出息了吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.17,0:07:48.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,白銀等級\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.88,0:07:50.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也不怎麼樣嘛！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.88,0:07:54.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你插什麼嘴啊！大人的談話你少來亂！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.39,0:07:59.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,老爸！不… 我是自衛團…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.06,0:08:01.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你就小嘍囉而已啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.89,0:08:04.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,想插嘴村子的會議 你還早一百年咧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.36,0:08:06.82,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,出去！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.90,0:08:13.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,搞什麼啦！可惡！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.66,0:08:16.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是做得到的好不好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.91,0:08:20.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真不好意思…\n我家那個蠢兒子給你添麻煩了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.33,0:08:22.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,請繼續吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.71,0:08:28.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,尖刺龍非常危險\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.29,0:08:29.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,正如奧利弗小姐所說\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.88,0:08:33.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,討伐應由多名人手一起行動會比較明智\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.59,0:08:36.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但幸好目前拉納中央城\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.59,0:08:38.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有一名有討伐尖刺龍經驗的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.85,0:08:40.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,銀等級冒險者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.89,0:08:41.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,預算呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.31,0:08:45.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,因為是七個村子聯合出資 應該在可負擔範圍內\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.85,0:08:46.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.94,0:08:48.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,另外呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.86,0:08:50.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,如果東雲先生也願意一起去\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.94,0:08:53.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那預算就能再壓低不少喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.36,0:08:56.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.08,0:09:06.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,反正近期也得去收拾尖刺龍…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.96,0:09:10.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那今天就先跟莉露去打史萊姆吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.25,0:09:11.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝您\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.84,0:09:13.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那個 不好意思\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.30,0:09:16.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,您是駐村的… 對吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.18,0:09:20.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那個…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.43,0:09:23.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,您有看到我兒子約翰嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.06,0:09:28.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,約翰 多納多 亞里莎\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.86,0:09:32.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那三個人都不見了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.36,0:09:36.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有人看到他們三個\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.11,0:09:39.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,往國見山方向的路走過去！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.12,0:09:41.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那群蠢蛋…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.99,0:09:43.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我去把他們拖回來痛扁一頓！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.62,0:09:44.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.91,0:09:47.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,現在去太危險了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.54,0:09:49.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,放開我 你們這些傢伙\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.54,0:09:50.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我去\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.17,0:09:54.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,把尖刺龍的資料 能給的都給我！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.84,0:09:55.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.84,0:09:56.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我也去幫忙\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.93,0:09:58.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不用！你別去！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.89,0:10:02.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,駐村的人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.43,0:10:06.69,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,必須為了整個村子的利益去工作…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.23,0:10:09.02,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼能為了那種蠢蛋\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.10,0:10:11.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,讓你去冒險啊 咳！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.40,0:10:16.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思… 可以拜託你嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.70,0:10:18.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,拜託您…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.07,0:10:21.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.20,0:10:23.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,加油啦 龍！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.20,0:10:27.12,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那個！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.42,0:10:31.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我聽說亞里莎他們出事了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.96,0:10:36.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 他們到底在幹嘛啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.76,0:10:42.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,別擔心啦 你朋友很快就會回來的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.97,0:10:47.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我可是白銀等級耶 懂嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.35,0:10:53.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好 那就拜託您了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.07,0:10:54.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.40,0:10:58.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那麼…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.11,0:10:59.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露留守\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.04,0:11:10.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（29歲單身中堅冒險家的日常）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.00,0:11:17.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好 那我出發了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.76,0:11:19.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉啦駐村的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.88,0:11:21.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我那蠢兒子給你添麻煩了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.43,0:11:24.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,只要你把他平安帶回來\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.26,0:11:28.02,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我就宰了他 那個蠢貨！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.31,0:11:30.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,拜託您了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.85,0:11:33.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.90,0:11:35.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,反正我也沒打算跟牠硬拚\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.32,0:11:38.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,只是把那三個人帶回來的話…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.45,0:11:49.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,把莉露也帶去真的沒問題嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.13,0:11:56.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,老實說\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.46,0:11:59.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,如果真的遇到尖刺龍的話\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.84,0:12:01.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就不能說“沒問題”了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.05,0:12:03.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.80,0:12:06.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是你的監護人！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.43,0:12:09.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你自己的命自己顧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.93,0:12:11.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫你留守你還硬跟來！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.10,0:12:14.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,死了可別怪我喔！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.31,0:12:17.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,交給我吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.23,0:12:21.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好 聽得懂就好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.65,0:12:22.49,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,走了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.90,0:12:24.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.61,0:12:25.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,會很搖晃喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.41,0:12:27.99,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嘴巴張著會咬到舌頭！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.45,0:12:29.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.74,0:12:31.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,所以就說別張嘴啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.96,0:12:33.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,想吐就早點說！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.46,0:12:35.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,還有上廁所也一樣喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.00,0:12:37.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,絕對不准漏尿出來！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.79,0:12:38.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,龍\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.55,0:12:39.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.96,0:12:41.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,所以就說不要張嘴\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.01,0:12:43.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,東雲先生…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.38,0:12:46.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你看起來根本就是監護人吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.30,0:12:50.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真的沒問題嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.44,0:12:55.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那個駐村的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.65,0:12:58.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,居然在怕一隻魔獸耶！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.57,0:12:59.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真丟臉\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.69,0:13:01.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,廢物膽小鬼啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.44,0:13:06.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要是你把那傢伙打倒 娜塔莉說不定會誇你喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.70,0:13:09.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我才沒那個意思！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.66,0:13:11.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,現在才藏有什麼用\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.62,0:13:12.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.25,0:13:14.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是看那傢伙不爽而已！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.51,0:13:26.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那是…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.39,0:13:30.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這也太大了吧…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.68,0:13:32.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我們還是回去比較好吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.48,0:13:35.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你… 你在說什麼啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.48,0:13:37.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你們在怕喔？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.98,0:13:39.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我才完全不怕咧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.27,0:13:44.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,自己的村子自己守啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.41,0:13:56.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎麼了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.88,0:14:02.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有東西來了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.22,0:14:13.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不會吧…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.72,0:14:18.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,尖 尖刺龍嗎！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.35,0:14:20.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也太大隻了吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.31,0:14:21.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼辦？約翰…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.98,0:14:23.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼辦… 還能怎麼辦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.03,0:14:25.99,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,只能上了吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.46,0:14:40.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,約翰！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.85,0:14:52.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,約翰！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.85,0:14:53.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你沒事吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.22,0:14:58.69,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,痛死了啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.73,0:15:02.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這下更不能讓那東西待在村子附近了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.09,0:15:25.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什麼…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.81,0:15:37.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.35,0:15:41.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,本來想不打就解決的說\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.77,0:15:43.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,駐村的…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.61,0:15:44.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你來幹嘛！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.27,0:15:46.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,工作\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.98,0:15:49.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這裡交給我 你們回村子！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.36,0:15:51.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你們的爸媽在等你們\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.91,0:15:54.74,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,快走！不然會妨礙到他！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.50,0:16:01.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,吃我這招莉露劍啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.13,0:16:06.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你這小鬼在幹嘛！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.34,0:16:07.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,很危險 過來我這邊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.00,0:16:10.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的！你幹嘛妨礙我啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.01,0:16:13.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,放開我！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.18,0:16:15.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你也一起走！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.06,0:16:19.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不過… 那傢伙\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.56,0:16:21.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,想一個人扛嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.64,0:16:23.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,再怎麼樣這也太亂來了吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.13,0:16:54.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,尖刺龍的弱點是…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.80,0:16:57.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,最好把那些刺全部弄掉\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.01,0:16:59.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始是這麼說的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.56,0:17:02.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那些刺就是弱點？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.68,0:17:04.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,刺沒了的話\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.60,0:17:07.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,身體好像就會變軟！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.49,0:17:15.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可是那刺到底有幾根啦…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.61,0:17:17.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼可能全部拔光\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.21,0:17:26.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,痛死了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.25,0:17:28.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,還好嗎 始？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.59,0:17:30.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,需要莉露幫忙嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.97,0:17:35.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,全身都是血耶！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.85,0:17:43.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我要殺了你\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.23,0:17:45.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這什麼怪力啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.14,0:18:23.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,居然正面單挑！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.91,0:18:49.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,太扯了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.96,0:18:53.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是白銀等級冒險者嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.80,0:19:00.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,居然只靠他一個人…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.68,0:19:01.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就打倒了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.43,0:19:06.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,總之 算是解決了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.81,0:19:08.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,雖然流了不少血\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.02,0:19:11.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但也正因為流血才打得倒…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.56,0:19:14.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.98,0:19:18.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,駐村的… 原來你這麼強…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.03,0:19:21.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,幹得好啊 始！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.49,0:19:22.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,工作還沒結束\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.45,0:19:25.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,回村子報告討伐結果\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.91,0:19:27.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,知道啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.29,0:19:30.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,的確…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.96,0:19:33.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有這傢伙在 對村子來說…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.67,0:19:37.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,地震？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.34,0:19:40.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,又來了？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.51,0:19:41.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是已經打倒了嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.52,0:19:50.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露！離遠一點！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.08,0:20:12.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可惡… 左臂被廢了！！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.38,0:20:15.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,而且 這傢伙到底是什麼…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.13,0:20:16.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我沒見過的魔物！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.71,0:20:20.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,冷靜！別慌！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.51,0:20:21.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,分析戰況！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.47,0:20:24.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要逃？還是要打？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.22,0:20:27.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不行… 感覺逃不掉…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.72,0:20:31.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,血流太多了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.81,0:20:33.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那就打？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.56,0:20:34.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可是…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.65,0:20:36.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這狀態不可能打持久戰…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.40,0:20:40.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要打就速戰速決！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.78,0:20:42.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,而且剛好…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.41,0:20:46.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,血也流得夠多了啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.33,0:20:54.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（始的能力 流血的鬥神）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.59,0:20:59.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,想逃？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.93,0:21:12.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,去死啦啊啊啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.45,0:21:30.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,打倒了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.21,0:21:36.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,總算撐過去了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.34,0:21:42.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,駐村的！你沒事吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.01,0:21:44.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你那手臂…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.42,0:21:45.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,快回村子！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.18,0:21:48.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不快點治療就…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.09,0:21:50.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.43,0:21:51.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,別那麼大聲！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.56,0:21:54.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,傷口會痛啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.31,0:21:56.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 我也是…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.64,0:21:57.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這種狀況正常都會慌吧…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.02,0:22:00.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,因為你護著莉露…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.15,0:22:04.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始的手臂才會…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.08,0:23:40.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（下回 戰後）\n
